message: "If you use GRN Atlas in academic work, please cite the software using this metadata and also cite the upstream data sources exposed by the atlas provenance and citations endpoints."
title: "GRN Atlas"
abstract: "Interactive multi-species gene regulatory network atlas with browser UI, FastAPI backend, and agent skills for network analysis, regulatory evidence review, perturbation planning, dsRNA design, and cross-species comparison."
